            "title": "Use Safety Screen",
            "heading_size": "large_text",
            "text": "<p>Ensure that a safety screen is securely in place when your fireplace is in operation to reduce the risk of potential burns. Missing a screen? <br/>Request a fire screen <a href=\"/pages/fireplace-safety-form\" title=\"Fireplace Safety Form\">here.</a></p>",
