            "heading-margin-top": 20,
            "title": "Be Vigilant",
            "heading_size": "large_text",
            "text": "<p>Never leave a fire unattended. Do not allow children or pets to get too close to the fireplace. Have your chimney and fireplace professionally inspected at least once a year. Install a carbon monoxide detector.</p>",
